%% Mermaid diagrams render inside Markdown fenced blocks (```mermaid)
%% This .mermaid file shows the syntax — paste into a .md file to render

flowchart TD
    A[Developer pushes code] --> B{CI passes?}
    B -- Yes --> C[Code review requested]
    B -- No --> D[Fix failing tests]
    D --> A
    C --> E{Approved?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Merge to main]
    E -- No --> G[Address feedback]
    G --> C
    F --> H[Auto-deploy to staging]
    H --> I{Smoke tests pass?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Deploy to production]
    I -- No --> K[Rollback & alert]
